OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly freezing fog patches
OL,6,Fclear slowly, leaving bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. A few showers push into the
OL,8,Fnorth from late morning becoming
OL,9,Ffrequent, heavy and wintry here in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe south will continue
OL,13,Fmostly dry and frosty with clear
OL,14,Fspells while blustery showers, some
OL,15,Fwintry, continue in the north at
OL,16,Ftimes. Becoming windy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FAnother day of blustery
OL,19,Fshowers in the north, these wintry
OL,20,Fover high ground. The south continues
OL,21,Fdry and bright. Continuing windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
